WEBVTT

00:00:18.318 --> 00:00:24.985
Why? Somehow you seem upset
Why? Nandaka ochikonderu mitai

00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:33.395
Voice, my voice. I want it to reach you
Voice, my voice. Todoketai yo kimi ni

00:00:33.967 --> 00:00:41.897
Things aren't going the way you'd like
Omoi douri ni naranai koto nara

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:50.308
That might happen a lot now, but...
Ima wa takusan attarisuru kedo

00:00:52.685 --> 00:00:57.179
Tomorrow, another new wind
Mata ashita wa chigau kaze

00:00:57.657 --> 00:01:00.649
will blow your way
fuite kuru yo

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:05.760
Spread your arms and let your chest
Ryoute wo hirogeta mune ni

00:01:05.999 --> 00:01:09.094
just feel the breeze
kanjiru mama

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:13.930
No matter what befalls us,
Nani ga osoi kakattemo

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:17.335
no matter how difficult it may be
semetatete mo

00:01:17.977 --> 00:01:24.576
We'll be all right
Watashi tachi wa daijoubu

00:01:32.225 --> 00:01:34.387
Snow blankets everything in white.

00:01:35.195 --> 00:01:38.221
If there's sorrow, snow will
softly surround you...

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:42.099
If there's happiness,
snow will decorate it gently...

00:01:42.669 --> 00:01:45.400
Silently, the snow keeps falling...

00:01:48.675 --> 00:01:55.206
Before Winter Comes

00:01:56.716 --> 00:01:58.343
It's winter break!

00:01:58.418 --> 00:02:00.696
It's beautiful outside, but it's freezing!

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:02.711
Yeah, maybe it's going to snow?

00:02:02.856 --> 00:02:04.153
Snow?

00:02:04.491 --> 00:02:07.536
| bet Hokkaido is covered in snow by now.

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:09.605
AKi, are you going to visit him?

00:02:09.629 --> 00:02:11.941
Give me some travel money and I'll go!

00:02:11.965 --> 00:02:13.126
Get a job!

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:17.259
My legs and back have been
aching too much lately...

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:18.828
Yeah, yeah...

00:02:20.373 --> 00:02:21.841
By the way, Chiharu!

00:02:22.642 --> 00:02:25.634
| saw you talking to Kyoichi
at the closing ceremony!

00:02:25.812 --> 00:02:26.655
Are you guys back together?

00:02:26.679 --> 00:02:28.257
It's not like I ever stopped talking to him.

00:02:28.281 --> 00:02:31.683
Things aren't always as simple
as they are for you, Yumi.

00:02:32.285 --> 00:02:33.946
What is that supposed to mean?

00:02:34.087 --> 00:02:36.613
Hey, let's go to karaoke.
We haven't been in a while.

00:02:37.056 --> 00:02:37.967
Good idea.

00:02:37.991 --> 00:02:40.983
Sure! Let's celebrate winter break and sing!

00:02:41.094 --> 00:02:41.686
3&4 Floor Bowling Alley
Batting Cages on Roof

00:02:48.535 --> 00:02:49.730
Natsue...

00:02:50.203 --> 00:02:51.466
...is acting strange?

00:02:51.905 --> 00:02:54.966
Yeah, she calls me a lot lately.

00:03:00.647 --> 00:03:02.046
She called me last night, too.

00:03:02.382 --> 00:03:04.282
She called me for no reason.

00:03:04.951 --> 00:03:06.919
| wonder what her deal is?

00:03:07.487 --> 00:03:08.818
Just keep rubbing it in!

00:03:09.222 --> 00:03:11.623
Sounds like you guys are doing good.

00:03:12.125 --> 00:03:13.092
Damn it!

00:03:16.196 --> 00:03:19.860
Why are you guys mad? I don't get it.

00:03:20.233 --> 00:03:21.928
I'm the one who doesn't get it.

00:03:22.202 --> 00:03:23.946
| wonder why she likes such a ditzy,

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:25.748
flakey, hot-headed idiot like you?

00:03:25.772 --> 00:03:26.671
That Natsue...

00:03:27.173 --> 00:03:28.197
Tell me about it.

00:03:28.374 --> 00:03:31.366
Maybe Horikawa's the one who's mad?

00:03:38.351 --> 00:03:39.113
What the...

00:03:41.688 --> 00:03:43.884
Sorry, I've got to go shopping now.

00:03:44.357 --> 00:03:46.035
And I'm not supposed to waste...

00:03:46.059 --> 00:03:48.704
...a precious vacation day with other guys.

00:03:48.728 --> 00:03:50.105
It was my grandfather's last wish.

00:03:50.129 --> 00:03:51.494
What's that supposed to mean?

00:03:57.437 --> 00:03:59.405
Hey! Was that...

00:03:59.872 --> 00:04:00.862
No way!

00:04:03.643 --> 00:04:06.772
Why don't you ask Horikawa
out if you're bored?

00:04:06.846 --> 00:04:09.008
Why? There's no reason to.

00:04:09.616 --> 00:04:10.742
Yeah, yeah.

00:04:15.255 --> 00:04:17.246
Hello Yoshihko. it's Horikawa.

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:19.315
Yeah, what's up?

00:04:19.726 --> 00:04:24.459
Well... I was wondering what
you're doing tomorrow.

00:04:25.798 --> 00:04:26.492
Why?

00:04:26.933 --> 00:04:28.298
Why?

00:04:28.635 --> 00:04:31.832
I'm not really sure what to
say when you ask me that...

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:35.165
Is there a baseball club meeting?

00:04:35.375 --> 00:04:37.173
Sorry, I'll pass.

00:04:37.443 --> 00:04:38.604
That's not it...

00:04:39.279 --> 00:04:42.544
No... Nevermind. Goodbye.

00:04:49.055 --> 00:04:51.353
H-Hey! Be careful!

00:04:53.893 --> 00:04:54.883
Santa?

00:04:57.630 --> 00:05:00.463
Hey you! Watch where you're going!

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:02.359
| can't believe you!

00:05:02.568 --> 00:05:04.730
You didn't move over for a girl!

00:05:04.971 --> 00:05:07.049
I'm in a rush, you know!

00:05:07.073 --> 00:05:08.837
Well, soam I!

00:05:09.008 --> 00:05:10.386
Just because you're a girl...

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:12.488
...doesn't mean you can run
people over and not apologize!

00:05:12.512 --> 00:05:14.480
What? How dare you...

00:05:15.048 --> 00:05:18.109
Don't you know who you're talking to?

00:05:23.289 --> 00:05:24.723
A part-timer passing out flyers?

00:05:25.224 --> 00:05:26.749
No!

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:29.228
I'm...

00:05:29.896 --> 00:05:31.206
What?!

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:34.222
Don't tell me you're the real Santa Claus!

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:36.898
No, that's not it...

00:05:41.207 --> 00:05:44.053
Hey! Is that Santa Jyunna Morio?

00:05:44.077 --> 00:05:45.754
No way! Mori-Jyun?

00:05:45.778 --> 00:05:48.770
Are they shooting a commercial or something?

00:05:49.015 --> 00:05:50.592
Who's that guy she's with?

00:05:50.616 --> 00:05:52.414
Is he a friend of hers?

00:05:55.288 --> 00:05:57.733
Oh no! Look at the time!

00:05:57.757 --> 00:05:59.748
We're going to be late
getting back to the studio!

00:05:59.892 --> 00:06:02.657
Come on! Hurry up! Mr. Manager!

00:06:03.396 --> 00:06:04.830
Keep running!

00:06:04.997 --> 00:06:06.726
Well, see you later everyone!

00:06:08.801 --> 00:06:10.826
| forgot to take a picture!

00:06:11.971 --> 00:06:13.816
Hey! Wait a minute!

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:15.117
What do you mean, manager?

00:06:15.141 --> 00:06:17.633
Shut up! Stop complaining!

00:06:17.777 --> 00:06:21.213
Just be happy you're spending
time with a popular idol!

00:06:21.981 --> 00:06:23.278
An idol?

00:06:38.598 --> 00:06:42.296
Jeez... Where exactly did she
go for her break? Jyunna!

00:06:43.202 --> 00:06:44.863
Jyunna Morio...

00:06:45.271 --> 00:06:46.534
Nope, never heard of you.

00:06:47.106 --> 00:06:48.437
No way!

00:06:48.508 --> 00:06:50.738
You've never heard of Jyunna Morio?

00:06:51.177 --> 00:06:53.043
I'm in a lot of commercials.

00:06:53.246 --> 00:06:54.714
You really don't know who I am?

00:06:57.216 --> 00:06:58.479
Together at last!

00:07:04.257 --> 00:07:05.383
That commercial! That one!

00:07:06.025 --> 00:07:06.685
That?

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:08.486
That!

00:07:09.028 --> 00:07:09.824
For real?

00:07:10.096 --> 00:07:11.154
For real!

00:07:11.798 --> 00:07:12.390
See?

00:07:21.007 --> 00:07:22.372
You don't look like her.

00:07:26.846 --> 00:07:29.391
Hey! Is that how you treat people...

00:07:29.415 --> 00:07:30.826
...who bought you food?

00:07:30.850 --> 00:07:33.785
Well, I don't have any cash on me.

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:35.849
Here, I'll give you this instead.

00:07:35.955 --> 00:07:36.265
<i>W</i>
Porto @

00:07:36.289 --> 00:07:36.932
<i>W</i> Porto @ Here.

00:07:36.956 --> 00:07:37.286
<i>W</i>
Porto @

00:07:38.024 --> 00:07:39.890
You have a marker just for autographs...

00:07:40.793 --> 00:07:42.283
It's a must-have item for an idol.

00:07:45.431 --> 00:07:46.421
Oh, this?

00:07:46.766 --> 00:07:48.996
We were rehearsing for a Christmas Special.

00:07:54.273 --> 00:07:55.672
Come on. Let's stop wasting time.

00:07:55.942 --> 00:07:56.652
What do you mean?

00:07:56.676 --> 00:07:59.145
There's a place I really want to go.

00:07:59.378 --> 00:08:00.311
Will you take me?

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:01.975
Why me?

00:08:03.616 --> 00:08:06.677
You're going on a date with
me and you're not pleased?

00:08:06.919 --> 00:08:11.413
I'll take a Mori-Jyun framed
sticker-picture with you later, okay?

00:08:13.593 --> 00:08:16.972
Sorry, I'm not supposed to
deal with selfish Santas.

00:08:16.996 --> 00:08:18.828
It was my grandfather's last wish.

00:08:18.998 --> 00:08:20.509
Oh good!

00:08:20.533 --> 00:08:22.797
Then, you're allowed to deal with an idol.

00:08:22.969 --> 00:08:25.404
That goes against my grandmother's last wish.

00:08:25.738 --> 00:08:27.137
What's that supposed to mean?

00:08:36.148 --> 00:08:38.048
Thanks for the hamburger!

00:08:39.385 --> 00:08:41.820
Hey! Give me back my jacket!

00:08:41.888 --> 00:08:45.033
Was that Mori-Jyun? She's so thin!

00:08:45.057 --> 00:08:47.651
Hey, I wonder who that guy is?
Is that her boyfriend?

00:08:47.793 --> 00:08:50.439
No way! Mori-Jyun has bad taste in men!

00:08:50.463 --> 00:08:51.794
Totally!

00:08:51.964 --> 00:08:53.557
Tell me about it!

00:08:56.969 --> 00:08:58.266
It's cold!

00:09:12.351 --> 00:09:15.286
1 bet Horikawa would be
surprised if I told her about this.

00:09:22.461 --> 00:09:24.395
My phone card is in my jacket pocket!

00:09:24.497 --> 00:09:26.591
Hey, I heard Mori-Jyun is over there!

00:09:27.333 --> 00:09:29.802
Jyunna, w-where are you right now?!

00:09:30.303 --> 00:09:31.361
Where?

00:09:31.604 --> 00:09:34.869
| don't know, but I'm okay!

00:09:35.207 --> 00:09:36.572
Don't worry about me!

00:09:37.109 --> 00:09:38.770
| know, I understand!

00:09:39.145 --> 00:09:40.943
Please. Wait just a little longer.

00:09:41.380 --> 00:09:43.542
| promise I'll be back in time for the shoot.

00:09:43.983 --> 00:09:45.883
So, can I have a little more time please?

00:09:46.085 --> 00:09:47.382
| want some time for me...

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:55.025
Mori-Jyun?

00:09:55.161 --> 00:09:56.925
Really? She's the real thing!

00:09:57.463 --> 00:09:59.830
She's so cute! She's so tiny!

00:10:00.032 --> 00:10:01.932
U-Um...

00:10:02.501 --> 00:10:04.492
There you are, Miss Jyunna!

00:10:07.073 --> 00:10:08.871
We've been looking for you, Jyunna!

00:10:09.075 --> 00:10:11.840
The set is ready, so we need you back!

00:10:13.145 --> 00:10:14.670
Oh... Right...

00:10:15.948 --> 00:10:16.744
Excuse me!

00:10:16.849 --> 00:10:18.840
Please make way for Jyunna please! Excuse me!

00:10:20.853 --> 00:10:22.844
Guys! I love you!

00:10:23.089 --> 00:10:25.033
But I have to go back to work, so hang in there!

00:10:25.057 --> 00:10:26.650
This is a request from Mori-Jyun!

00:10:33.065 --> 00:10:36.399
Jeez! Idols are such a pain!

00:10:36.535 --> 00:10:38.731
Let's hurry, Mr. Manager!

00:10:38.938 --> 00:10:40.736
There's no time to lose!

00:10:41.173 --> 00:10:42.436
H-Hey...

00:10:42.541 --> 00:10:43.804
Just come!

00:10:44.110 --> 00:10:46.521
You're able to spend a day with a popular idol!

00:10:46.545 --> 00:10:49.276
Even my fan club members don't get to do this!

00:10:49.548 --> 00:10:51.448
You're such a lucky guy!

00:10:51.784 --> 00:10:52.842
Yeah right, jeez...

00:10:53.085 --> 00:10:56.282
Come on! Faster! Run!

00:11:16.909 --> 00:11:17.671
What the?

00:11:17.810 --> 00:11:19.107
What is this?

00:11:21.347 --> 00:11:23.782
Why am I the only one it won't let through?

00:11:24.150 --> 00:11:26.585
I've even been a one-day Station Chief!

00:11:31.657 --> 00:11:33.091
It opened! It opened!

00:11:33.392 --> 00:11:35.237
Let's go, Yoshi!

00:11:35.261 --> 00:11:37.093
"Let's go," whatever...

00:11:37.596 --> 00:11:39.564
Who does she think she's calling Yoshi!?

00:11:39.799 --> 00:11:42.928
Hurry! Hurry! You're too slow, Yoshi!

00:11:44.070 --> 00:11:45.265
Yeah, yeah...

00:11:47.273 --> 00:11:49.935
I've never been on a train before!

00:11:50.743 --> 00:11:54.690
I'm always in my manager's car or on
the agency's bus when I'm traveling.

00:11:54.714 --> 00:11:55.840
Good for you...

00:11:56.682 --> 00:11:58.226
That shop is so cute!

00:11:58.250 --> 00:11:59.081
Hey! Hey!

00:12:00.019 --> 00:12:02.386
Stop the train. Let's check it out!

00:12:02.755 --> 00:12:03.847
Now, listen...

00:12:04.223 --> 00:12:06.089
There's no way I can stop the train!

00:12:06.258 --> 00:12:07.157
Oh, I see...

00:12:07.326 --> 00:12:09.137
Obara Amusement Park

00:12:09.161 --> 00:12:09.971
Obara Amusement Park
Now I see.

00:12:09.995 --> 00:12:10.120
Obara Amusement Park

00:12:10.429 --> 00:12:12.488
You just wanted to go out and have fun.

00:12:12.998 --> 00:12:16.093
| didn't know Jyunna Morio was so childish.

00:12:17.603 --> 00:12:19.981
Yoshi! What are you doing over there?

00:12:20.005 --> 00:12:21.200
| can't getin!

00:12:21.874 --> 00:12:24.206
Then buy a ticket!

00:12:29.048 --> 00:12:30.846
Hey! Turn around!

00:12:31.417 --> 00:12:33.078
You've been napping long enough!

00:12:33.853 --> 00:12:37.517
You need to cater to your customers more!

00:12:39.458 --> 00:12:40.948
That's it?

00:12:41.127 --> 00:12:42.322
Let's go to the next one!

00:12:42.528 --> 00:12:44.087
We're going to see a bear?

00:12:44.263 --> 00:12:45.822
Come on, hurry!

00:12:48.667 --> 00:12:49.566
Oh no...

00:12:50.636 --> 00:12:52.536
Hey! What do you think you're doing?

00:12:52.772 --> 00:12:54.883
No pictures allowed!

00:12:54.907 --> 00:12:57.899
Yeah! Take a better a shot!

00:13:08.154 --> 00:13:10.282
How's this pose to finish it up?

00:13:13.993 --> 00:13:15.757
You cater too much!

00:13:26.172 --> 00:13:28.300
Tea time already?

00:13:28.574 --> 00:13:30.008
This is such a typical date route.

00:13:31.977 --> 00:13:35.379
Not here either. Let's go to the next one!

00:13:36.615 --> 00:13:37.844
Why you...

00:13:46.192 --> 00:13:47.717
What do you think you're looking at!?

00:13:57.636 --> 00:13:59.502
Here, have some more!

00:14:11.050 --> 00:14:11.949
What?

00:14:12.351 --> 00:14:16.379
Hey, are you Mori-Jyun? Or are you Santa?

00:14:19.458 --> 00:14:23.793
Actually, Mori-Jyun's real
identity is Santa Claus.

00:14:23.929 --> 00:14:24.828
Really?

00:14:25.030 --> 00:14:25.656
Yup!

00:14:27.199 --> 00:14:29.725
And that's my reindeer.

00:14:30.402 --> 00:14:31.927
He looks like a reindeer!

00:14:33.005 --> 00:14:34.598
| get that a lot...

00:14:35.374 --> 00:14:40.312
But don't tell anyone! This
will be our secret, okay?

00:14:40.512 --> 00:14:42.503
Okay! It's a secret!

00:14:45.417 --> 00:14:48.478
| promise I'll keep it a secret!

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:52.856
| had no idea how famous...

00:14:54.593 --> 00:14:56.152
...Jyunna Morio is.

00:14:56.328 --> 00:14:57.796
Of course I am!

00:14:57.963 --> 00:15:01.331
You're like the only one in Japan
that doesn't know who I am!

00:15:05.871 --> 00:15:08.363
No... You're the second person.

00:15:09.208 --> 00:15:11.108
Santa Claus and a reindeer...

00:15:11.443 --> 00:15:15.073
If that were true, we'd be
able to fly into the sky...

00:15:15.981 --> 00:15:17.073
Then...

00:15:25.758 --> 00:15:28.284
Now what?

00:15:38.504 --> 00:15:39.369
H-Hey!

00:15:40.072 --> 00:15:41.130
| don't see him.

00:15:41.774 --> 00:15:44.505
| thought I'd be able to see him from here...

00:15:45.744 --> 00:15:46.575
Jyunna?

00:15:50.683 --> 00:15:55.780
He's in the television business, but
he doesn't know anything about idols.

00:15:55.955 --> 00:15:58.424
We were always fighting when we first met.

00:15:58.891 --> 00:16:00.757
Is he your...

00:16:01.593 --> 00:16:04.756
Yeah... He's my boyfriend.

00:16:05.364 --> 00:16:07.059
He's the most important person to me.

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:09.165
| just wanted to see him.

00:16:09.535 --> 00:16:12.232
| heard he was shooting here today, so...

00:16:13.372 --> 00:16:14.840
You wanted to see him?

00:16:15.274 --> 00:16:17.242
Did something happen at work?

00:16:18.043 --> 00:16:20.322
No, I like my job.

00:16:20.346 --> 00:16:25.512
The staff are sweet and
they all like me. It's great.

00:16:25.951 --> 00:16:27.817
Then, why?

00:16:28.020 --> 00:16:31.046
Why? I wonder why?

00:16:33.559 --> 00:16:35.823
Letters and phone calls aren't enough...

00:16:36.128 --> 00:16:38.096
| just wanted to see him.

00:16:39.031 --> 00:16:41.591
| don't need a reason to feel that way.

00:16:43.302 --> 00:16:45.862
Do you ever get that way, Yoshi?

00:16:47.306 --> 00:16:48.364
Jeez...

00:16:49.341 --> 00:16:50.809
| just don't get it...

00:16:57.649 --> 00:16:58.616
Hey, look!

00:17:07.726 --> 00:17:11.253
Let me off! Now! Let me off!

00:17:11.563 --> 00:17:13.258
Why is this thing so slow?

00:17:13.365 --> 00:17:14.764
Please, hurry!

00:17:15.734 --> 00:17:16.633
Jyunna...

00:17:19.104 --> 00:17:20.299
It's hopeless...

00:17:20.906 --> 00:17:22.635
| guess I won't see him after all...

00:17:23.042 --> 00:17:23.873
Jyunna.

00:17:25.544 --> 00:17:26.670
Don't give up.

00:17:28.781 --> 00:17:30.078
Don't give up!

00:17:39.992 --> 00:17:42.120
You've come this far,
don't get discouraged now!

00:17:42.327 --> 00:17:44.305
Keep smiling to the end if you're an idol!

00:17:44.329 --> 00:17:45.160
Got it!

00:18:32.578 --> 00:18:33.374
Jyunna.

00:18:39.118 --> 00:18:40.847
| knew it was you!

00:19:03.375 --> 00:19:05.036
I'm glad I stayed.

00:19:05.544 --> 00:19:07.103
Everyone's going crazy!

00:19:07.446 --> 00:19:08.857
They're all like, "Mori-Jyun is here!"

00:19:08.881 --> 00:19:11.009
| wanted to see you!

00:19:11.116 --> 00:19:13.744
But I'm surprised you were
able to come all the way here.

00:19:14.119 --> 00:19:17.646
That's because Yoshi helped me! Right?

00:19:24.696 --> 00:19:25.356
Who?

00:19:30.435 --> 00:19:34.201
My excellent manager, and also my reindeer.

00:19:35.374 --> 00:19:37.069
Thank you... Yoshihiko.

00:19:53.592 --> 00:19:55.151
Hello, Horikawa residence.

00:19:56.695 --> 00:19:58.740
It's me, Kenjo.

00:19:58.764 --> 00:20:01.529
Yoshihiko?! What's wrong?

00:20:01.767 --> 00:20:05.203
It's strange, you don't normally call me.

00:20:05.304 --> 00:20:06.533
R... Really?

00:20:08.006 --> 00:20:10.475
There's no special reason, but...

00:20:10.842 --> 00:20:12.776
...wanted to see you, so...

00:20:16.048 --> 00:20:16.810
Horikawa?

00:20:17.182 --> 00:20:19.014
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:20:19.451 --> 00:20:22.546
Don't surprise me like that!

00:20:23.121 --> 00:20:23.917
Oh...

00:20:25.157 --> 00:20:25.953
What is it?

00:20:27.526 --> 00:20:30.154
Look what happens when you do
something you don't normally do.

00:20:33.699 --> 00:20:34.791
It's snowing...

00:20:37.569 --> 00:20:39.799
<i>it'll be a white Christmas.</i>

00:20:40.172 --> 00:20:40.764
What?

00:20:41.573 --> 00:20:43.974
“What?" Oh, come on...

00:20:44.209 --> 00:20:46.735
Today's Christmas Eve, Yoshihiko.

00:20:47.512 --> 00:20:48.741
Oh, that's right!

00:20:50.582 --> 00:20:52.880
Snow blankets everything in white.

00:20:53.952 --> 00:20:57.354
If there's sorrow, snow will
softly surround you...

00:20:57.990 --> 00:21:01.426
If there's happiness,
snow will decorate it gently...

00:21:06.331 --> 00:21:07.127
See you!

00:21:07.699 --> 00:21:09.258
Yep! Hang in there!

00:21:11.703 --> 00:21:15.162
Silently, the snow keeps falling...

00:21:21.780 --> 00:21:24.511
There's no reason,
Riyuu nanka nakute

00:21:24.716 --> 00:21:30.348
we're just happy when we're together
issho nara ureshiku nattari

00:21:31.056 --> 00:21:39.056
Somehow we connect, everyone together
Nanto naku tsuuji au minna ga ii ne

00:21:47.372 --> 00:21:52.469
We lay down on the riverbed
Kawara no shamen nekoron da

00:21:52.644 --> 00:21:55.545
stretching our arms and legs
teashi wo nobashite

00:21:56.682 --> 00:22:04.521
Birds flew above our heads
Atama no ue wo tori tachi ga tobitatta

00:22:06.024 --> 00:22:10.552
I just look up at the sky
Futo miageta kyou no sora

00:22:10.729 --> 00:22:13.528
it seems to spread forever
doko mademo hirogaru

00:22:14.166 --> 00:22:19.263
All the things bothering me
Donna yuutsu na koto demo

00:22:19.404 --> 00:22:24.240
<i>seem so small
chiisaku omoeru yo</i>

00:22:27.012 --> 00:22:29.857
There's no reason,
Riyuu nanka nakute

00:22:29.881 --> 00:22:35.820
we just sing our favorite songs
suki na uta kuchi zusande tari

00:22:36.254 --> 00:22:44.254
That's the best, that's when it feels great
Sonna toki ga ichiban kimochi ga ii ne

00:22:51.002 --> 00:22:53.835
Next Episode

00:22:55.006 --> 00:22:58.442
Rumors, New Years Eve, the new century...

00:22:59.578 --> 00:23:02.570
The person you are with the
moment it turns to 2001...

00:23:02.881 --> 00:23:04.474
...is the person you will live
happily ever after with.

00:23:05.717 --> 00:23:06.843
| wonder if that's true?

00:23:07.219 --> 00:23:09.153
If so, then I...

00:23:09.554 --> 00:23:10.665
The Thousand-Year Vow

